Subject: [PATCH 07/10] SBC Dual Channel (SBC HD) support - redux

Instead of adding a new channel mode type we use the
pre-existing architecture to introduce a custom SBC codec.
The only difference is that it has a "codec specific" value
that will be checked when picking the bitrate to be used.

